ak"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨が横降りのときって\n傘ってどこ方向にかたむけたらいいか\n難しいよね(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨がくる方に向けても頭濡れるし\n普通に上に向けても横から入ってくるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうのを\n頭いい人は\n自分の進む速度とか雨の降る速度とか風速とかで\nさいんこさいんたんじぇんととかして\n傘を傾ける角度とか考えてるのかなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりむずかしいや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/9545943/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃん＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}